---
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_TAGLINE } from '../consts';
const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10 mb-12">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Bio -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500 to-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-lg">
            🌱
          </div>
          <span class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">{SITE_TITLE}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-md leading-relaxed">
          {SITE_TAGLINE}. Media literasi pengembangan diri independen untuk membantu generasi produktif membangun mindset bertumbuh, mengelola emosi, dan merawat kebiasaan bermakna.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg w-fit">
          <span>✨ Dibangun dengan Astro + React + Vue + Tailwind</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigasi Topik -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-200 mb-4">
          Pilar Pertumbuhan
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">🧠 Mindset & Mental Health</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">⏱️ Produktivitas & Fokus</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">🎯 Atomic Habits</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">💬 Komunikasi Asertif</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Portal & Menu -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-200 mb-4">
          Tautan
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Beranda</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Daftar Artikel</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#tracker" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Habit Tracker (Vue)</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/about" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Tentang Penulis</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 gap-4">
      <p>&copy; {today.getFullYear()} {SITE_TITLE}. Hak Cipta Dilindungi.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-400">
        Bertumbuh 1% lebih baik setiap hari 🌿
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
